WEBVTT

01:35.759 --> 01:40.820
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.440 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 36]

01:45.310 --> 01:47.200
This is all because of you,

01:47.200 --> 01:48.039
Mother!

02:11.840 --> 02:12.450
I know

02:12.870 --> 02:13.710
you let Xia Jingshi go

02:13.710 --> 02:15.770
because you were afraid I'd kill him.

02:16.560 --> 02:18.200
But I'll say it again—

02:18.430 --> 02:19.430
he may look like a beaten dog,

02:19.430 --> 02:21.030
but he's actually a wolf cub!

02:21.030 --> 02:22.690
Sooner or later, he will bite!

02:24.680 --> 02:26.430
You're the one who's been deceived,

02:26.430 --> 02:27.150
Mother!

02:33.079 --> 02:35.079
Emperor, you are the ruler of this nation.

02:35.079 --> 02:36.490
If you want to strip him
of his military power,

02:36.490 --> 02:37.890
I won't stand in your way.

02:38.520 --> 02:40.630
But you must wait until
after the Qianqiu Festival.

02:40.630 --> 02:42.079
Every year during the festival,

02:42.079 --> 02:42.840
those old generals

02:42.840 --> 02:44.870
come to the capital,
as tradition dictates.

02:44.870 --> 02:46.670
I will personally appease them.

02:47.000 --> 02:48.130
After the festival,

02:48.960 --> 02:50.290
whatever you wish to do,

02:50.910 --> 02:52.280
I will not interfere.

03:00.360 --> 03:01.160
Do you mean it?

03:02.240 --> 03:02.840
I do.

03:05.840 --> 03:06.770
Then it's a deal.

03:15.940 --> 03:19.040
[Serene Abode]

03:37.590 --> 03:38.450
Your Highness,

03:38.590 --> 03:39.310
our troops

03:39.590 --> 03:41.150
have departed Pingling City

03:41.150 --> 03:42.630
and are heading to the capital.

03:42.630 --> 03:43.630
Send word to them—

03:43.680 --> 03:45.140
they must move in secrecy.

03:45.430 --> 03:47.560
Anyone who discovers them along the way

03:47.560 --> 03:48.560
must be silenced.

03:48.840 --> 03:49.280
Yes!

03:58.079 --> 03:58.960
Your Majesty,

03:59.400 --> 04:00.400
the Ministry of Rites
has received a letter

04:00.400 --> 04:01.600
from Susha.

04:01.710 --> 04:02.710
It's addressed to

04:02.910 --> 04:04.370
Princess Xiyang of Susha.

04:05.910 --> 04:06.640
Let me see it.

04:10.350 --> 04:11.530
[To Feng Xiyang]

04:25.160 --> 04:26.020
Your Highness,

04:26.430 --> 04:28.160
isn't Xia Jingyan the emperor?

04:28.480 --> 04:29.870
The palace has every medicine imaginable.

04:29.870 --> 04:31.730
Why go to all this trouble for him?

04:32.150 --> 04:33.530
Since I need his help,

04:33.630 --> 04:35.560
I should naturally show sincerity.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.680
Besides, Xia Jingyan is

04:36.680 --> 04:37.950
temperamental and unpredictable.

04:37.950 --> 04:40.010
I can't figure out what's on his mind.

04:40.800 --> 04:42.190
I'm just afraid
he might suddenly change his mind

04:42.190 --> 04:43.390
and refuse to help me.

04:44.070 --> 04:44.730
In any case,

04:45.159 --> 04:46.730
keeping him pleased for now

04:46.800 --> 04:47.510
can't hurt.

05:00.430 --> 05:01.720
Why grind up these perfectly

05:01.720 --> 05:02.560
good flowers?

05:03.000 --> 05:04.350
They're Chinese roses.

05:04.600 --> 05:05.870
I searched the entire Flower Hall

05:05.870 --> 05:07.270
to gather just these few.

05:12.340 --> 05:14.070
With so many rare and exotic flowers,

05:14.070 --> 05:15.020
you only prefer

05:15.070 --> 05:15.870
those

05:15.870 --> 05:16.850
that look common.

05:16.850 --> 05:17.780
What do you know?

05:18.680 --> 05:19.950
Applying crushed Chinese roses externally

05:19.950 --> 05:21.120
can promote blood circulation,

05:21.120 --> 05:22.920
reduce swelling, and ease pain.

05:24.000 --> 05:24.750
You're hurt?

05:25.480 --> 05:26.210
It's for you.

05:27.750 --> 05:28.680
Didn't you strain your arm

05:28.680 --> 05:30.010
by dry-firing your bow?

05:42.600 --> 05:43.860
So you do care about me.

05:44.270 --> 05:45.670
Don't flatter yourself.

05:45.950 --> 05:46.750
I'm the type of person

05:46.750 --> 05:47.270
who would help

05:47.270 --> 05:48.730
even injured cats and dogs

05:48.800 --> 05:50.000
if I came across them.

05:50.950 --> 05:52.480
Don't read too much into it.

05:54.510 --> 05:55.800
There's a letter for you.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.730
I wasn't planning to give it to you.

05:57.830 --> 05:59.190
But for the sake of this rose ointment,

05:58.690 --> 06:00.100
[To Feng Xiyang]

05:59.480 --> 06:00.360
I'll let you read it.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.290
What does it say?

06:02.920 --> 06:04.750
Your brother might still be alive.

06:04.750 --> 06:05.190
This letter

06:05.190 --> 06:06.310
might be from him.

06:06.660 --> 06:06.870
[To Feng Xiyang]

06:09.190 --> 06:11.050
We don't know who sent the letter.

06:11.270 --> 06:12.330
It may be a forgery.

06:12.430 --> 06:12.920
Perhaps

06:12.920 --> 06:13.920
some fool wrote it

06:13.950 --> 06:14.810
to toy with you.

06:16.560 --> 06:17.560
"I'm still alive.

06:18.000 --> 06:19.000
All is well.

06:19.480 --> 06:20.390
Don't worry."

06:20.760 --> 06:22.410
[Ge]

06:29.830 --> 06:31.760
This is my brother's handwriting.

06:35.480 --> 06:36.950
This is a letter from him...

06:36.490 --> 06:38.630
[I'm still alive. All is well.
Don't worry. Ge]

06:40.040 --> 06:41.120
I knew it.

06:43.510 --> 06:44.630
I knew my brother

06:44.630 --> 06:46.270
would never abandon me.

07:03.000 --> 07:05.130
Your Majesty, are you feeling unwell?

07:06.070 --> 07:07.270
I don't know why,

07:08.160 --> 07:09.430
but a strange sense of unease
came over me.

07:09.430 --> 07:11.830
Should we call for the imperial physician?

07:12.680 --> 07:14.950
His Majesty has arrived!

07:22.360 --> 07:23.000
Didn't I tell you to

07:23.000 --> 07:25.270
reflect on your actions in Yinghua Palace?

07:25.270 --> 07:26.800
What are you all good for?

07:27.560 --> 07:28.270
I ordered you

07:28.270 --> 07:29.730
to watch over His Majesty.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.250
Who dares to stop me?

07:35.630 --> 07:37.690
I'm in no mood to argue with you today.

07:38.430 --> 07:39.360
Go back and rest.

07:40.480 --> 07:41.750
I didn't come to argue.

07:43.680 --> 07:45.280
I came for the Imperial Seal.

07:45.390 --> 07:47.070
The Keeper of the Imperial Seal said

07:47.070 --> 07:48.670
the seal is with you, Mother.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.510
What do you need the seal for?

07:51.510 --> 07:53.170
I am the ruler of this country.

07:53.630 --> 07:55.630
What's wrong with me using the seal?

07:57.920 --> 07:58.560
Very well.

07:59.830 --> 08:01.480
You are the ruler of this country.

08:01.480 --> 08:02.120
Guards!

08:02.870 --> 08:04.830
Escort the ruler of this country back

08:04.830 --> 08:06.510
and don't let him wander around.

08:06.510 --> 08:07.190
Mother!

08:08.430 --> 08:10.430
Please hand over the Imperial Seal.

08:11.000 --> 08:13.130
So you still remember I'm your mother?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.430
Is this how you speak

08:14.430 --> 08:15.690
to your mother?

08:15.830 --> 08:17.190
I'm going to issue an edict

08:17.190 --> 08:19.360
stripping Murong Zhong and his son

08:19.430 --> 08:21.750
of their command over the Imperial Guards.

08:21.750 --> 08:23.750
Empress Dowager, I request that...

08:23.870 --> 08:25.670
you hand over the Imperial Seal.

08:28.120 --> 08:28.750
Emperor,

08:29.750 --> 08:30.920
in front of others,

08:31.360 --> 08:32.820
you should behave more appropriately.

08:32.820 --> 08:33.679
Jinwu Guards,

08:34.510 --> 08:36.120
escort His Majesty back to rest!

08:36.120 --> 08:37.179
Stop me if you dare!

08:43.120 --> 08:43.720
Come here.

08:44.960 --> 08:45.750
Come here!

08:47.200 --> 08:48.260
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:48.890 --> 08:49.610
I ask you,

08:50.120 --> 08:51.780
who do the Jinwu Guards serve?

08:54.240 --> 08:55.040
Your Majesty,

08:55.360 --> 08:57.390
the Jinwu Guards serve as
the emperor's personal guards.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.790
They take orders directly from the emperor

08:58.790 --> 09:00.550
and are responsible for
protecting the imperial residences

09:00.550 --> 09:02.360
and ensuring the safety
of the imperial family.

09:02.360 --> 09:04.690
"Take orders directly from the emperor."

09:05.840 --> 09:07.270
What do these words mean?

09:09.750 --> 09:10.790
I'm asking you a question!

09:10.790 --> 09:12.790
Whose approval are you waiting for?

09:13.750 --> 09:14.720
Please forgive me, Your Majesty!

09:14.720 --> 09:15.380
Chengyang!

09:16.120 --> 09:17.250
Stop this nonsense!

09:17.910 --> 09:18.660
As I've said,

09:19.510 --> 09:20.440
I am the Emperor.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.480
This imperial palace,

09:22.480 --> 09:23.540
all of Yujing City,

09:23.600 --> 09:24.790
and even the entire Susha

09:24.790 --> 09:25.990
are under my command.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.150
You palace guards—

09:29.840 --> 09:31.600
if you cannot follow my orders,

09:32.360 --> 09:34.290
then you need not serve any longer.

09:38.030 --> 09:38.760
This subject

09:39.000 --> 09:40.660
is at Your Majesty's command!

09:41.670 --> 09:42.800
All of you, leave us.

09:48.140 --> 09:50.790
I have something to say to His Majesty.

09:52.120 --> 09:52.980
All of you, out.

09:53.440 --> 09:54.500
Yes, Your Majesty.

10:07.270 --> 10:08.600
Have you lost your mind?

10:08.910 --> 10:09.960
In front of all those people,

10:09.960 --> 10:11.030
what are you trying to do?

10:11.030 --> 10:12.490
Are you attempting a coup?

10:12.920 --> 10:14.350
You asked me to reflect,

10:15.360 --> 10:17.220
and I've realized only one thing—

10:17.550 --> 10:18.870
I no longer wish to play

10:19.670 --> 10:21.020
the emperor.

10:21.440 --> 10:22.720
And the last thing I will do

10:22.720 --> 10:24.320
as this puppet emperor

10:25.910 --> 10:27.600
is reclaim military power

10:28.360 --> 10:30.150
and clear the obstacles for my brother

10:30.150 --> 10:31.320
so he can eliminate
Murong Zhong and his son

10:31.320 --> 10:33.240
without concern for future troubles!

10:33.240 --> 10:33.640
You...

10:40.480 --> 10:41.810
My mind is made up.

10:42.390 --> 10:44.850
If you refuse to hand over
the Imperial Seal,

10:45.080 --> 10:47.080
I'll summon all the court officials

10:47.510 --> 10:50.970
and publicly announce the removal
of their military command.

10:52.080 --> 10:52.720
Guards!

10:53.120 --> 10:54.180
Yes, Your Majesty!

10:57.670 --> 10:58.670
Convey my decree:

10:59.480 --> 11:00.870
Strip the Commandery Prince of Yishu,

11:00.870 --> 11:02.660
Murong Yao,

11:02.750 --> 11:03.600
of his command

11:03.600 --> 11:05.390
over the Imperial Guards immediately.

11:05.390 --> 11:06.600
All Imperial Guards

11:07.150 --> 11:08.760
shall obey only my commands.

11:09.080 --> 11:10.080
Those who disobey

11:10.720 --> 11:11.720
shall be executed.

11:11.720 --> 11:12.840
Yes, Your Majesty!

11:31.530 --> 11:33.720
By the mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor of Susha

11:33.720 --> 11:34.480
decrees:

11:34.600 --> 11:37.030
The Commandery Prince of Yishu,
Murong Yao,

11:37.030 --> 11:38.670
is hereby ordered to
return home immediately and rest.

11:38.670 --> 11:40.320
The position of Commander
of the Imperial Guards

11:40.320 --> 11:42.030
shall be filled
by another worthy candidate.

11:42.030 --> 11:43.200
By imperial order.

11:44.240 --> 11:45.100
Your Lordship.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.250
Quickly accept the decree.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.000
This subject

11:50.510 --> 11:51.640
accepts the decree.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.030
Prepare the carriage.

12:11.030 --> 12:12.200
I'm going into the palace.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.530
When my father returns,

12:13.550 --> 12:15.750
tell him I've gone to see
the Empress Dowager.

12:15.750 --> 12:16.410
-Yes.
-Yes.

12:18.320 --> 12:19.600
Calm yourself for now.

12:20.480 --> 12:21.670
Your command

12:21.720 --> 12:23.720
has only been temporarily removed.

12:23.870 --> 12:25.150
Once the situation stabilizes,

12:25.150 --> 12:26.610
it will be restored to you.

12:27.440 --> 12:28.000
What troubles me is not

12:28.000 --> 12:29.600
the loss of command
over the Imperial Guards,

12:29.600 --> 12:31.930
but the reason behind this sudden change!

12:33.600 --> 12:34.660
Could it be that...

12:35.000 --> 12:35.910
Your Majesty the Empress Dowager has lost

12:35.910 --> 12:36.840
control over His Majesty?

12:36.840 --> 12:37.440
Insolent!

12:38.120 --> 12:39.510
How dare you speak

12:39.910 --> 12:41.510
such treasonous words to me!

12:44.030 --> 12:45.390
This subject has gravely offended you.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.840
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.720
At this point, I just want to know

12:49.000 --> 12:50.600
what exactly happened in the palace.

12:50.600 --> 12:52.120
His Majesty went to see Feng Suige,

12:52.120 --> 12:52.870
and upon his return,

12:52.870 --> 12:54.080
stripped me of my command.

12:54.080 --> 12:54.670
Isn't that because

12:54.670 --> 12:56.670
you and your father failed in your duty?

12:56.670 --> 12:57.790
Feng Suige is still alive,

12:57.790 --> 12:59.790
and I have yet to hold you to account.

13:01.390 --> 13:03.360
For now, I won't pursue this matter.

13:03.360 --> 13:04.420
The top priority is

13:04.750 --> 13:05.840
to wait for your father

13:05.840 --> 13:07.510
to secure control of the Feng Battalion.

13:07.510 --> 13:09.630
You must kill Feng Suige
as soon as possible.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.690
As for His Majesty,

13:11.030 --> 13:12.550
I will handle him myself.

13:22.270 --> 13:26.170
[Murong Residence]

13:52.930 --> 13:54.450
[Murong Residence]

14:00.630 --> 14:01.240
My Lord!

14:01.670 --> 14:02.530
Terrible news!

14:28.310 --> 14:30.120
[Murong Residence]

14:43.430 --> 14:47.060
[Murong Residence]

15:58.670 --> 15:59.670
Feng Suige,

16:00.030 --> 16:00.750
come out!

16:05.080 --> 16:07.440
[Noble Virtue and Lofty Spirit]

16:15.100 --> 16:15.980
Feng Suige,

16:16.270 --> 16:17.130
show yourself!

16:29.360 --> 16:29.840
Father?

16:40.720 --> 16:41.390
Father!

16:44.840 --> 16:45.900
Father, wake up...

16:46.620 --> 16:47.910
Wake up, Father!

16:49.790 --> 16:50.440
Father!

16:54.510 --> 16:55.000
Father!

16:56.870 --> 16:58.290
I was wrong.

16:58.360 --> 17:00.380
It was all my fault.

17:00.630 --> 17:02.100
If only I had listened to you back then

17:02.100 --> 17:04.000
and been content as a spoiled noble,

17:04.000 --> 17:05.800
this would never have happened.

17:05.880 --> 17:06.680
I just wanted

17:06.680 --> 17:08.550
to change our family's fate.

17:08.880 --> 17:11.079
I never thought it would cost your life,

17:11.480 --> 17:12.079
Father...

17:13.480 --> 17:14.790
I was wrong.

17:15.030 --> 17:16.960
I've failed you as a son!

17:18.640 --> 17:20.569
When you tried to kill me before...

17:23.640 --> 17:25.310
it was just like this.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.150
Feng Suige!

17:31.440 --> 17:32.830
If you have a grievance,
take it out on me!

17:32.830 --> 17:33.440
Why couldn't you

17:33.440 --> 17:34.370
spare my father?

17:34.920 --> 17:36.030
Did you ever think about

17:36.030 --> 17:37.470
sparing my father?

17:38.070 --> 17:39.590
Back then, when you conspired with Jinxiu,

17:39.590 --> 17:40.830
did you think about sparing

17:40.830 --> 17:42.640
those innocent Susha soldiers?

17:43.070 --> 17:44.200
When you personally

17:44.240 --> 17:45.700
buried me in the ground,

17:45.880 --> 17:46.960
did you remember

17:46.960 --> 17:48.610
we were once like brothers?

17:48.720 --> 17:49.440
I considered you

17:49.440 --> 17:50.950
my best friend!

17:51.440 --> 17:54.000
But from the moment
you conspired with Zhuang Shen,

17:54.000 --> 17:55.000
you knew

17:55.000 --> 17:56.920
we'd become enemies.

17:58.200 --> 17:58.880
I never expected

17:58.880 --> 17:59.720
that we would

17:59.720 --> 18:00.610
come to this.

18:01.110 --> 18:02.900
When I watched you die,

18:03.550 --> 18:04.640
I felt awful too.

18:05.310 --> 18:06.730
But now I regret it!

18:07.000 --> 18:07.790
I regret not

18:07.790 --> 18:09.590
making sure you were truly dead!

18:10.000 --> 18:11.310
At this point,

18:11.920 --> 18:13.920
there's no need for empty words.

18:14.680 --> 18:15.440
Today,

18:16.110 --> 18:17.170
I'll show no mercy.

18:17.590 --> 18:19.750
I'll rip you to shreds!

18:19.860 --> 18:20.750
I'll kill you

18:20.750 --> 18:21.960
to avenge my father!

18:57.270 --> 18:58.030
This man has been

18:58.030 --> 18:59.680
my best friend since childhood.

18:59.680 --> 19:01.340
He's a rare and honored guest.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.650
Make sure he's well taken care of.

19:11.650 --> 19:12.390
Yao!

19:12.430 --> 19:13.520
Do it now!

19:13.590 --> 19:14.310
Yao,

19:14.440 --> 19:15.350
do it!

19:15.680 --> 19:16.640
Kill him!

19:46.370 --> 19:48.170
I still can't believe

19:48.350 --> 19:49.910
that my son

19:50.070 --> 19:50.750
is actually

19:50.750 --> 19:53.350
a villain who kills innocent people.

19:55.640 --> 19:58.570
Only you are the most important
to the Murong family.

20:10.590 --> 20:11.660
In this world,

20:12.070 --> 20:14.070
nothing is more important than you.

20:14.680 --> 20:15.480
For you,

20:16.350 --> 20:18.240
I can give up everything.

20:18.590 --> 20:19.350
Traitor

20:19.440 --> 20:20.240
or

20:20.880 --> 20:21.550
rebel—

20:22.680 --> 20:24.550
let them call me whatever they will.

20:24.550 --> 20:26.210
As long as I can save your life,

20:26.920 --> 20:28.520
I'll accept whatever comes,

20:29.160 --> 20:30.220
no matter the cost!

21:32.960 --> 21:34.030
I've avenged

21:35.550 --> 21:36.750
our fellow soldiers.

21:45.310 --> 21:46.170
Your Highness,

21:46.440 --> 21:47.370
I need to go back.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.160
Their memorial tablets are

21:48.160 --> 21:49.160
still at my place.

21:49.790 --> 21:51.050
All of you, go with Song

21:51.790 --> 21:53.550
to bring them back.

21:54.590 --> 21:55.790
-Alright.
-Alright.

22:09.670 --> 22:11.390
[Wutong Mansion]

22:17.350 --> 22:18.720
Your Highness the First Prince,

22:18.720 --> 22:20.850
His Majesty is waiting for you inside.

22:31.680 --> 22:32.310
Brother.

22:34.550 --> 22:35.880
You're going to Jinxiu?

22:38.000 --> 22:39.730
I'm going to bring Xiyang back.

22:40.110 --> 22:41.340
She's all alone

22:41.440 --> 22:42.440
in a foreign land.

22:42.810 --> 22:44.410
I don't know how she's doing.

22:45.510 --> 22:46.770
I'm worried about her.

22:47.480 --> 22:48.610
When will you leave?

22:49.750 --> 22:51.410
I'll depart at dawn tomorrow.

22:55.590 --> 22:56.550
We're brothers

22:56.550 --> 22:58.270
who've been through so much together.

22:58.270 --> 23:00.270
If you have something to say, say it.

23:01.030 --> 23:01.560
Brother.

23:04.200 --> 23:04.960
My mother...

23:06.720 --> 23:08.650
I promised you I wouldn't kill her.

23:09.070 --> 23:10.000
I remember that.

23:11.720 --> 23:12.310
Brother,

23:12.830 --> 23:14.290
are you leaving tomorrow?

23:14.400 --> 23:15.000
But

23:15.030 --> 23:15.920
I haven't had the chance

23:15.920 --> 23:17.450
to return the throne to you.

23:17.920 --> 23:18.580
Chengyang,

23:19.240 --> 23:20.070
this time you chose

23:20.070 --> 23:21.210
to stand with me

23:21.750 --> 23:23.400
and helped me so much.

23:23.830 --> 23:24.400
I know

23:25.240 --> 23:27.570
it must be hard for you
to face your mother.

23:28.160 --> 23:28.910
I understand

23:29.440 --> 23:30.750
these things clearly.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.110
Suige.

23:39.960 --> 23:40.760
I've decided.

23:42.070 --> 23:42.750
I'll take Mother

23:42.750 --> 23:44.350
to guard Father's mausoleum

23:44.830 --> 23:46.310
and pray that Father's spirit

23:46.310 --> 23:47.310
may rest in peace.

24:01.970 --> 24:04.860
[Shousheng Palace]

24:20.590 --> 24:22.170
The Jinwu Guards at the door

24:22.480 --> 24:24.290
dare stop me from going out.

24:24.920 --> 24:26.250
What do you mean by that—

24:26.880 --> 24:29.010
are you putting me under house arrest?

24:30.110 --> 24:31.910
Mother, you must be eager to know

24:32.880 --> 24:34.030
who won—Murong Zhong and his son,

24:34.030 --> 24:35.270
or my brother?

24:37.400 --> 24:39.400
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

24:40.510 --> 24:42.370
Murong Zhong and his son are dead.

24:42.920 --> 24:43.920
The Murong family

24:44.520 --> 24:46.350
will be erased from Susha.

24:48.310 --> 24:49.240
What did you say?

24:50.160 --> 24:51.290
That's impossible!

24:51.440 --> 24:52.830
Even if the Murong family were to fall,

24:52.830 --> 24:54.690
it couldn't happen this quickly!

24:56.310 --> 24:56.970
Chengyang,

24:57.440 --> 24:58.240
do you know...

24:59.640 --> 25:01.500
without Murong Zhong and his son,

25:01.720 --> 25:02.680
you and I

25:02.680 --> 25:03.400
are no match

25:03.400 --> 25:04.440
for Feng Suige?

25:05.160 --> 25:05.790
Mother,

25:06.880 --> 25:08.070
I know the truth now.

25:09.400 --> 25:10.270
What truth?

25:11.480 --> 25:13.280
The truth about Father's death.

25:19.160 --> 25:19.820
Chengyang,

25:20.310 --> 25:21.840
what are you talking about?

25:22.830 --> 25:23.770
Tell Mother—

25:24.400 --> 25:25.070
who

25:25.070 --> 25:26.480
has been filling your head with nonsense?

25:26.480 --> 25:27.660
Is it Feng Suige?

25:27.920 --> 25:28.920
He's lying to you.

25:29.000 --> 25:30.440
He's trying to sow discord between us!

25:30.440 --> 25:31.160
Mother!

25:32.470 --> 25:33.800
When Murong Zhong died,

25:35.240 --> 25:36.960
he'd already told my brother everything.

25:36.960 --> 25:38.580
Feng Suige is lying!

25:38.640 --> 25:39.970
How can you believe him?

25:40.770 --> 25:42.230
Whatever you heard,

25:42.480 --> 25:43.550
I didn't do it.

25:43.760 --> 25:45.890
None of this has anything to do with me!

25:46.070 --> 25:46.800
It wasn't me.

25:50.200 --> 25:50.860
Chengyang,

25:51.240 --> 25:52.160
listen to me.

25:52.550 --> 25:54.030
Are you still my son or not?

25:54.400 --> 25:55.920
If you still acknowledge me
as your mother,

25:55.920 --> 25:57.210
you must believe me!

25:58.160 --> 26:00.000
I've always been your son.

26:01.110 --> 26:02.030
In my heart,

26:02.350 --> 26:04.210
no one is more important than you.

26:04.720 --> 26:06.070
That's why I can't watch you

26:06.070 --> 26:07.480
continue down this wrong path.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.540
I've told you—

26:08.720 --> 26:09.860
I didn't do it!

26:09.920 --> 26:11.680
I didn't kill your father!

26:11.790 --> 26:12.590
Mother!

26:13.440 --> 26:15.440
The truth will come out eventually.

26:15.790 --> 26:17.320
It can't be hidden anymore.

26:18.790 --> 26:19.310
No.

26:22.550 --> 26:23.480
I cannot lose.

26:24.120 --> 26:26.480
I've fought so hard to get to
where I am today.

26:26.480 --> 26:27.680
I cannot lose!

26:29.160 --> 26:31.220
Aren't Murong Zhong and his son dead?

26:33.270 --> 26:33.830
Right.

26:34.790 --> 26:35.770
They're dead.

26:36.240 --> 26:37.330
All the secrets

26:37.590 --> 26:39.160
should be buried with them.

26:41.350 --> 26:42.010
Chengyang.

26:42.590 --> 26:44.030
Help me announce to the world

26:44.030 --> 26:45.360
that all of this was done

26:45.550 --> 26:47.280
by Murong Zhong and his son.

26:48.640 --> 26:50.170
It can't be hidden anymore.

26:51.510 --> 26:52.170
Chengyang,

26:52.480 --> 26:53.920
everything I've done

26:54.510 --> 26:56.030
was for you.

26:58.480 --> 26:59.080
Mother...

27:00.510 --> 27:01.970
You're saying that again.

27:03.680 --> 27:04.550
You've always been

27:04.550 --> 27:06.070
driven by your own obsession:

27:06.070 --> 27:07.750
your son must be emperor.

27:08.720 --> 27:09.590
Whether your son

27:09.590 --> 27:10.850
was me or someone else,

27:10.920 --> 27:12.850
you would have done the same thing.

27:13.400 --> 27:15.260
Don't use me as an excuse anymore.

27:17.360 --> 27:18.680
How could you say

27:18.680 --> 27:20.030
such unfilial things to me?

27:20.030 --> 27:21.900
Why have you come here to hurt me?

27:22.680 --> 27:24.540
No matter what you've done wrong,

27:24.750 --> 27:26.610
I will atone for it on your behalf.

27:28.500 --> 27:29.830
What are you going to do?

27:30.510 --> 27:32.030
I'm going to return the throne

27:32.030 --> 27:32.890
to my brother.

27:33.270 --> 27:34.550
He'll rule Susha.

27:35.350 --> 27:36.310
Only then

27:36.680 --> 27:38.500
can Father rest in peace.

27:40.350 --> 27:40.920
Mother,

27:41.510 --> 27:42.640
please don't worry.

27:42.640 --> 27:44.100
I'll always stay with you.

27:44.640 --> 27:45.640
We'll go together

27:46.310 --> 27:47.970
to guard Father's mausoleum.

27:52.030 --> 27:52.640
No!

27:55.110 --> 27:55.830
I won't!

27:56.070 --> 27:56.920
Never!

28:03.640 --> 28:04.750
My mind is made up.

28:09.920 --> 28:10.800
Chengyang...

28:11.590 --> 28:12.400
Chengyang!

28:16.350 --> 28:17.750
Chengyang, you can't do this to me.

28:17.750 --> 28:18.440
Chengyang!

28:19.590 --> 28:20.350
Chengyang!

28:24.000 --> 28:24.720
Chengyang!

28:26.110 --> 28:26.830
Chengyang,

28:27.280 --> 28:29.140
you can't do this to me...

28:30.240 --> 28:32.550
You can't do this to your mother,

28:32.550 --> 28:33.510
Chengyang!

28:35.920 --> 28:37.680
Chengyang!

28:39.750 --> 28:40.610
Your Highness,

28:40.680 --> 28:41.680
we're all ready.

28:42.070 --> 28:43.550
We're just waiting for Your Highness
to give the command,

28:43.550 --> 28:44.880
and we'll follow you to the death

28:44.880 --> 28:45.590
to reclaim your throne!

28:45.590 --> 28:47.720
The throne rightfully belongs to you!

28:49.440 --> 28:50.480
You have all followed me for many years

28:50.480 --> 28:52.010
and are like brothers to me.

28:52.110 --> 28:53.680
You all know what kind of man

28:54.310 --> 28:55.360
I, Feng Suige, am.

28:56.550 --> 28:58.210
I don't care about the throne.

28:58.310 --> 28:59.240
What I care about

28:59.960 --> 29:01.000
is fighting alongside you

29:01.000 --> 29:02.400
to protect our homeland.

29:03.200 --> 29:04.640
So, please stop trying

29:04.640 --> 29:06.270
to persuade me to take the throne.

29:06.270 --> 29:07.920
Susha's peace was hard-won.

29:07.940 --> 29:09.270
There must be no more chaos.

29:09.270 --> 29:12.270
Otherwise, it's always the common people
who suffer.

29:13.480 --> 29:14.210
Today,

29:14.550 --> 29:16.180
I'll depart for Jinxiu

29:16.230 --> 29:17.560
to bring back my sister.

29:17.640 --> 29:19.030
While I'm gone,

29:19.680 --> 29:20.910
I hope all of you

29:20.960 --> 29:22.680
will protect Susha for me.

29:23.160 --> 29:25.480
-We will definitely guard our homeland
-We will definitely guard our homeland

29:25.480 --> 29:27.880
-until Your Highness returns!
-until Your Highness returns!

29:27.880 --> 29:28.480
All right.

29:29.310 --> 29:30.310
You may leave now.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.340
-Yes!
-Yes!

29:37.270 --> 29:37.830
Yun Qing,

29:38.550 --> 29:39.500
Lu Ke and Yun Fang

29:39.590 --> 29:41.160
will accompany me to Jinxiu.

29:41.160 --> 29:43.350
I'm counting on you to manage things here.

29:43.350 --> 29:43.880
Besides,

29:43.920 --> 29:44.960
there's another important task

29:44.960 --> 29:46.270
I need to entrust to you.

29:46.270 --> 29:47.270
Help me investigate

29:47.270 --> 29:49.310
the truth behind the raid
on the Storm Alliance back then.

29:49.310 --> 29:49.790
Yes.

29:50.640 --> 29:52.030
I suspect it was most likely

29:52.030 --> 29:53.650
Zhuang Shen who did it.

29:53.880 --> 29:55.610
But we don't have evidence yet.

29:55.750 --> 29:57.160
If he really did it,

29:57.510 --> 29:59.960
someone in the Zhuang family
must know about it.

29:59.960 --> 30:01.270
Among those exiled from the Zhuang family,

30:01.270 --> 30:02.870
someone must know the truth.

30:03.400 --> 30:04.310
Start there

30:04.480 --> 30:05.590
to find a breakthrough.

30:05.590 --> 30:06.540
Then dig deeper

30:06.640 --> 30:07.700
until you uncover the truth.

30:07.700 --> 30:08.430
Understood.

30:08.550 --> 30:10.480
You can count on me, Your Highness.

30:10.510 --> 30:11.970
On your journey to Jinxiu,

30:12.750 --> 30:14.000
be sure to stay safe.

30:14.270 --> 30:15.000
Don't worry.

30:16.030 --> 30:16.630
Oh, right.

30:16.970 --> 30:18.180
[Ning Fei]

30:17.550 --> 30:18.110
Rush

30:18.440 --> 30:20.140
this letter to Ning Fei

30:20.400 --> 30:21.010
at Zhengnian Villa.

30:21.010 --> 30:22.700
[Ning Fei]

30:23.550 --> 30:24.110
Yes.

30:28.270 --> 30:30.240
What right do you have to keep me here?

30:30.240 --> 30:31.030
My brother is still alive.

30:31.030 --> 30:33.430
Of course, I need to return to Susha
to find him!

30:33.430 --> 30:34.390
Just think about

30:34.750 --> 30:36.030
all the things you've done for Xia Jingshi

30:36.030 --> 30:37.550
that angered your brother.

30:37.550 --> 30:39.150
You think he wants to see you?

30:39.720 --> 30:40.850
Get out of my way!

30:41.510 --> 30:42.250
Feng Xiyang!

30:42.830 --> 30:43.720
Remember this:

30:44.240 --> 30:45.400
you're mine now!

30:45.720 --> 30:47.120
Whether you stay or go...

30:47.750 --> 30:49.350
depends entirely on my mood.

30:55.030 --> 30:55.960
Are you alright?

30:56.030 --> 30:56.890
Someone, come!

30:57.590 --> 30:58.070
Xiyang?

30:59.000 --> 30:59.460
Xiyang!

31:06.830 --> 31:09.030
Why would she suddenly faint like that?

31:10.400 --> 31:11.550
Her Highness is pregnant.

31:11.550 --> 31:12.350
Your Majesty,

31:12.480 --> 31:14.750
Princess Xiyang is with child.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.570
What did you say?

31:19.310 --> 31:20.920
She's definitely pregnant.

31:22.730 --> 31:24.550
If you dare make a wrong diagnosis,

31:24.550 --> 31:25.680
I'll have your head.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.310
I wouldn't dare give a false diagnosis.

31:28.310 --> 31:30.350
Her Highness is indeed pregnant.

31:32.350 --> 31:32.880
Get out.

31:33.310 --> 31:33.720
Yes.

31:38.880 --> 31:39.740
All of you, out.

31:47.900 --> 31:48.900
You're pregnant.

31:50.030 --> 31:51.030
Whose child is it?

32:02.480 --> 32:03.310
You and Xia Jingshi

32:03.310 --> 32:04.330
were married

32:04.720 --> 32:06.780
but never consummated the marriage.

32:06.790 --> 32:07.720
If this child isn't mine,

32:07.720 --> 32:08.980
then whose could it be?

32:12.240 --> 32:13.300
That's wonderful.

32:15.110 --> 32:15.840
Feng Xiyang,

32:16.230 --> 32:17.090
I'll marry you.

32:17.310 --> 32:18.710
I'll make you my Empress!

32:19.000 --> 32:20.900
I, Feng Xiyang, would sooner die

32:21.680 --> 32:23.160
than become your Empress!

32:36.000 --> 32:37.860
Your Highness, you've returned.

32:40.640 --> 32:41.700
You must be hungry.

32:42.030 --> 32:43.830
Shall I have the meal brought in?

32:51.200 --> 32:52.030
Your Highness, you've had

32:52.030 --> 32:53.680
little appetite these past few days.

32:53.680 --> 32:55.000
I've had hawthorn and apricot soup

32:55.000 --> 32:56.060
prepared for you.

32:56.510 --> 32:57.440
It's sweet and sour

32:57.440 --> 32:59.500
and should stimulate your appetite.

33:00.160 --> 33:01.690
What are you talking about?

33:02.720 --> 33:03.580
Your Highness,

33:03.590 --> 33:04.210
are...

33:04.550 --> 33:05.550
are you all right?

33:09.110 --> 33:10.030
This maid will go see

33:10.030 --> 33:11.350
if lunch is ready.

34:35.110 --> 34:35.840
This subject

34:36.400 --> 34:37.550
pays respects to Your Majesty.

34:37.550 --> 34:39.010
Speak plainly. What is it?

34:39.320 --> 34:40.120
Your Majesty,

34:40.190 --> 34:41.850
an urgent message from Susha—

34:41.880 --> 34:42.960
Feng Suige is already

34:42.960 --> 34:44.560
on his way to Shengjing City.

34:46.320 --> 34:47.520
What is he coming for?

34:47.670 --> 34:48.469
Your Majesty,

34:48.550 --> 34:49.750
the message only says

34:49.840 --> 34:52.300
Feng Suige wishes to
meet with Your Majesty.

34:54.510 --> 34:56.570
He's coming to take Feng Xiyang back.

34:57.880 --> 34:58.550
I won't see him.

34:58.550 --> 35:00.070
Find some excuse to turn him away.

35:00.070 --> 35:01.280
Yes, Your Majesty.

35:03.000 --> 35:03.630
Wait.

35:05.320 --> 35:07.250
The news of Feng Suige coming to Shengjing

35:07.250 --> 35:07.670
must never

35:07.670 --> 35:09.000
reach Princess Xiyang.

35:09.630 --> 35:11.030
If you leak a word of this,

35:11.440 --> 35:12.500
I'll not spare you.

35:12.920 --> 35:13.440
Yes.

35:14.150 --> 35:15.360
I understand, Your Highness.

35:15.360 --> 35:17.020
I understand, Your Highness.

35:25.790 --> 35:30.290
[Princess Xiyang is secretly pregnant
with the Emperor's child.]

35:43.030 --> 35:43.890
Your Highness,

35:44.000 --> 35:45.000
our undercover guards

35:45.000 --> 35:47.330
have secretly arrived in Shengjing City.

35:48.630 --> 35:49.490
Your Highness?

35:49.880 --> 35:52.210
She's pregnant with Xia Jingyan's child.

35:52.230 --> 35:54.000
You mean Princess Xiyang?

35:54.400 --> 35:56.360
If she had listened to me back then

35:56.780 --> 35:58.040
and returned to Susha,

35:58.280 --> 35:59.110
none of this

35:59.110 --> 36:00.310
would have happened.

36:01.510 --> 36:02.760
It's too late now.

36:03.550 --> 36:05.280
She brought this upon herself.

36:05.710 --> 36:07.370
She has only herself to blame.

36:07.840 --> 36:09.550
At midnight on Xia Jingyan's birthday,

36:09.550 --> 36:10.800
he'll go to the ancestral home

36:10.800 --> 36:12.150
to pay respects to the ancestors.

36:12.150 --> 36:12.880
He usually

36:12.880 --> 36:14.610
arrives there a day in advance.

36:14.670 --> 36:16.320
And this time, he'll certainly
bring Feng Xiyang

36:16.320 --> 36:17.150
with him.

36:17.440 --> 36:18.220
At that time,

36:18.360 --> 36:19.360
the Empress Dowager will help us

36:19.360 --> 36:21.490
remove the Royal Guards from his side.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.630
Xia Jingyan and Feng Xiyang...

36:26.960 --> 36:28.150
must both die.

36:29.160 --> 36:32.810
[Shengjing City, Jinxiu Kingdom]

36:46.230 --> 36:47.480
You're quite familiar with this place.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.940
Have you been here before?

36:49.920 --> 36:50.880
I came here once

36:50.880 --> 36:52.150
when I had business outside the border.

36:52.150 --> 36:53.370
After all these years,

36:53.370 --> 36:54.700
it hasn't changed much.

36:55.800 --> 36:57.660
I didn't expect it to be so lively.

36:57.880 --> 36:58.920
Because the day after tomorrow

36:58.920 --> 37:00.650
is Jinxiu's Qianqiu Festival—

37:00.670 --> 37:01.440
that is, Emperor

37:01.440 --> 37:02.840
Xia Jingyan's birthday.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.880
According to Jinxiu customs,

37:04.880 --> 37:06.550
the Qianqiu Festival lasts three days.

37:06.550 --> 37:08.220
At midnight on his birthday, the Emperor

37:08.220 --> 37:10.280
visits his ancestral home
to honor his ancestors.

37:10.280 --> 37:11.240
Later that day,

37:11.360 --> 37:13.590
he parades through the streets
to celebrate with the people.

37:13.590 --> 37:14.520
On the third day,

37:14.590 --> 37:15.400
he meets

37:15.510 --> 37:16.320
the nobles and officials

37:16.320 --> 37:18.520
from all regions who come to pay homage.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.290
Yun Fang.

37:21.590 --> 37:23.150
Go to the Ministry of Rites now and ask

37:23.150 --> 37:24.030
when our meeting

37:24.030 --> 37:25.190
with Xia Jingyan is scheduled.

37:25.190 --> 37:25.920
Understood.

37:29.440 --> 37:31.240
Yunlai Inn should be over there.

37:31.510 --> 37:33.150
Let's go there first to settle in.

37:33.150 --> 37:33.750
All right.

37:40.220 --> 37:42.370
[Yunlai Inn]

37:42.370 --> 37:45.990
[Closed]

37:53.280 --> 37:54.140
Your Highness.

37:55.800 --> 37:57.270
[Yu Qi, Secret Agent of Feng Battalion]

37:56.050 --> 37:57.580
I knew you were still alive.

37:57.800 --> 37:59.030
No need for formalities.

37:59.030 --> 37:59.590
Get up.

38:01.880 --> 38:02.810
His name is Yu Qi.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.110
He's a secret agent
from my Feng Battalion,

38:05.110 --> 38:06.070
operating undercover in Jinxiu

38:06.070 --> 38:08.070
under my orders to collect intelligence.

38:08.070 --> 38:09.200
We've come this time

38:09.320 --> 38:10.650
to bring my sister back.

38:10.920 --> 38:11.850
How is she doing?

38:12.230 --> 38:13.760
According to news from the palace,

38:13.760 --> 38:14.440
Princess Xiyang

38:14.440 --> 38:16.230
has divorced the Prince of Zhennan,
Xia Jingshi.

38:16.230 --> 38:17.280
It was Princess Xiyang

38:17.280 --> 38:18.840
who repudiated Xia Jingshi.

38:18.840 --> 38:19.440
What?

38:19.590 --> 38:20.630
How is that possible?

38:20.630 --> 38:21.840
Princess Xiyang has always been devoted

38:21.840 --> 38:22.700
to Xia Jingshi.

38:22.880 --> 38:23.880
How could she repudiate him?

38:23.880 --> 38:24.940
I looked into it too

38:25.070 --> 38:25.960
but couldn't find out

38:25.960 --> 38:26.710
the reason.

38:27.030 --> 38:28.020
There are rumors

38:28.150 --> 38:31.010
that this matter is related to
Emperor Xia Jingyan.

38:31.230 --> 38:32.070
Your Highness,

38:32.070 --> 38:33.150
I went to the Ministry of Rites and asked.

38:33.150 --> 38:34.070
Those fools said

38:34.070 --> 38:35.550
the meeting time hasn't been arranged yet.

38:35.550 --> 38:36.110
They said

38:36.150 --> 38:37.070
we have to wait until
after the Qianqiu Festival.

38:37.070 --> 38:37.870
I've told them

38:38.190 --> 38:39.280
to inform us here at once

38:39.280 --> 38:41.010
if there are any developments.

38:41.670 --> 38:42.440
They're clearly

38:42.440 --> 38:43.770
just stalling for time.

38:44.000 --> 38:46.150
Xiyang might already be in trouble.

38:47.440 --> 38:48.440
Stay calm for now.

38:48.590 --> 38:49.480
On our way here,

38:49.480 --> 38:50.510
I already told you about this.

38:50.510 --> 38:50.840
This time,

38:50.840 --> 38:52.550
bringing Princess Xiyang back to Susha

38:52.550 --> 38:53.360
won't be easy.

38:53.710 --> 38:55.710
I know better than anyone how deeply

38:55.760 --> 38:57.360
Xiyang's feelings run for Xia Jingshi.

38:57.360 --> 38:59.070
How could she possibly repudiate him?

38:59.070 --> 39:00.280
Besides, everyone knows

39:00.280 --> 39:01.440
the Emperor of Jinxiu, Xia Jingyan,

39:01.440 --> 39:02.640
is not a man of virtue.

39:03.190 --> 39:04.360
If he's involved in this,

39:04.360 --> 39:05.890
then I'm even more worried.

39:06.630 --> 39:09.030
Why is he preventing me
from seeing Xiyang?

39:09.550 --> 39:10.250
Perhaps

39:10.510 --> 39:11.970
he wants to use your sister

39:12.110 --> 39:13.310
as leverage for power

39:13.670 --> 39:15.080
or for some other reason.

39:15.590 --> 39:16.420
In any case,

39:16.670 --> 39:17.880
our urgent priority is

39:17.880 --> 39:18.710
to find out

39:18.710 --> 39:20.400
about Xiyang's situation in the palace.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.550
I was in Jinxiu for many years.

39:21.550 --> 39:22.280
I have a way.

39:23.190 --> 39:24.090
I know a woman.

39:24.150 --> 39:25.280
Her name is Peiniang.

39:25.280 --> 39:27.440
She was once a palace attendant
in the Jinxiu Imperial Palace

39:27.440 --> 39:29.000
and served there for over  20 years.

39:29.000 --> 39:30.190
She's very well-informed.

39:30.190 --> 39:30.880
I've had

39:30.880 --> 39:31.920
some dealings with her in the past.

39:31.920 --> 39:33.110
Perhaps she can help us.

39:33.110 --> 39:34.040
Where is she now?

39:34.360 --> 39:35.400
After leaving the palace,

39:35.400 --> 39:36.190
she opened

39:36.190 --> 39:37.550
a rouge shop in Shengjing City.

39:37.550 --> 39:39.440
I'll go find out
about Xiyang's situation first.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.370
Wait for my news.

39:40.510 --> 39:41.470
Please be careful.

39:41.470 --> 39:48.160
[Shunhua Rouge Shop]

39:46.630 --> 39:48.890
Miss, feel free to try whatever you like.

39:51.030 --> 39:52.760
Do you have rouge for warriors?

39:55.710 --> 39:57.400
Rouge for warriors?

39:58.150 --> 39:59.590
The kind that won't come off

39:59.590 --> 40:00.000
even when sweating

40:00.000 --> 40:01.230
in battle.

40:02.150 --> 40:03.630
Last time I asked you this,

40:03.920 --> 40:04.800
you said,

40:04.840 --> 40:07.110
"What proper lady would go to battle

40:07.590 --> 40:08.520
wearing rouge?"

40:10.710 --> 40:11.960
Fu Yixiao.

40:14.650 --> 40:15.550
[Shunhua Rouge Shop]

40:24.070 --> 40:25.600
It really is you, Fu Yixiao.

40:25.710 --> 40:26.840
You're still alive.

40:28.440 --> 40:30.150
I thought something had happened to you.

40:30.150 --> 40:31.280
Do I look like

40:31.480 --> 40:33.080
something's happened to me?

40:34.070 --> 40:34.670
Peiniang,

40:34.710 --> 40:35.710
let's talk business.

40:35.710 --> 40:36.400
I've come to

40:36.440 --> 40:37.400
ask you a favor.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.630
I want to know about

40:39.880 --> 40:41.590
the Princess of Susha's situation
in the Jinxiu Imperial Palace.

40:41.590 --> 40:42.650
Princess of Susha?

40:45.760 --> 40:47.150
You know my rules.

40:48.000 --> 40:49.430
If you want my help,

40:49.670 --> 40:51.670
there has to be something in return.

40:51.710 --> 40:52.960
My story is long.

40:53.110 --> 40:54.190
If you want to hear it,

40:54.190 --> 40:56.120
you'll need to do me another favor.

40:57.070 --> 40:57.800
Find a chance

40:58.400 --> 41:00.460
to pass a message to Princess Xiyang.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.700
That's not difficult.

41:04.610 --> 41:05.600
[Qin'an Hall]

41:11.700 --> 41:13.020
[Shiyu, Shi'an, Shiyou, Shiyun]

41:14.800 --> 41:15.760
You've come at the right time.

41:15.760 --> 41:16.710
Look at these names

41:16.710 --> 41:17.440
and tell me which one you like...

41:17.440 --> 41:18.880
My brother
has already arrived in Shengjing.

41:18.880 --> 41:20.140
Why didn't you tell me?

41:20.880 --> 41:22.000
You actually found that out.

41:22.000 --> 41:23.330
I want to see my brother.

41:25.400 --> 41:25.840
I've told you

41:25.840 --> 41:27.570
I won't let you return to Susha.

41:27.630 --> 41:29.360
No matter the cost,

41:30.230 --> 41:32.160
I must return to my brother's side.

41:32.880 --> 41:34.030
He's my only family

41:34.030 --> 41:35.090
left in this world.

41:36.880 --> 41:38.820
♪ Flying alone ♪

41:39.500 --> 41:42.550
♪ With no need for direction ♪

41:40.800 --> 41:41.600
What about me?

41:42.000 --> 41:42.760
What am I to you?

41:42.760 --> 41:43.550
Xia Jingyan,

41:44.000 --> 41:45.190
between you and me,
it was only a transaction!

41:44.710 --> 41:46.840
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

41:45.190 --> 41:46.110
Nothing more!

41:47.450 --> 41:49.990
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

41:47.630 --> 41:48.490
A transaction?

41:49.280 --> 41:51.150
There's only a transaction between us?

41:51.150 --> 41:52.110
Isn't that so?

41:52.550 --> 41:54.160
♪ Roaming freely ♪

41:54.710 --> 41:57.820
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

41:55.510 --> 41:56.800
State your terms.

41:58.110 --> 41:58.920
What would it take for you

41:58.920 --> 41:59.920
to let me go back?

41:59.910 --> 42:01.740
♪ The wet wings ♪

42:02.130 --> 42:04.890
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

42:05.150 --> 42:06.230
What right do you have

42:06.230 --> 42:07.830
to keep negotiating with me?

42:11.230 --> 42:12.400
If you don't agree,

42:12.450 --> 42:15.740
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

42:12.840 --> 42:14.300
I'll die right here today,

42:14.670 --> 42:16.400
along with the child in my womb!

42:16.510 --> 42:17.670
You're threatening me again!

42:17.670 --> 42:18.920
I'm just reminding you!
